{
  "id": 439841803,
  "iid": 22719,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "epan: Use unsigned offsets with tvb_bytes_exist and _offset_exists",
  "description": "There are no cases in the repository where this is used with a negative\noffset. Because a negative offset means \"from the end of the captured\ndata\" (not the reported data, as one might think), using it with a\nnegative offset probably doesn't do what someone expects, and there's\nusually a more sensible way to express the same idea.\n\nPing #20103",
